## Development Journey

The project was built incrementally rather than starting directly with Roles.

```text
SSH & Inventory
       ↓
Baseline Playbook
       ↓
Variables & Facts
       ↓
User Management
       ↓
Nginx Automation
       ↓
Jinja2 & Handlers
       ↓
Refactor into Roles
       ↓
Firewall & Security
       ↓
Final Infrastructure Playbook
```

This progression demonstrates both basic Ansible concepts and the transition toward a more maintainable project structure.

